{"id":"n64772-1-8","stage":5,"title":"수화기 · 听筒","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64772-1-8-1","ko":"잠깐만, 민준아. 가스레인지 불을 좀 끄고 올게. 수화기를 내려놓지 마.","zh":"等一下，敏俊啊。我先把燃气灶的火关了再过来。别挂电话哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠깐만,","meaning":"一下，暂时地","explanation":"잠깐：一下，暂时地；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57313","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준아.","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"가스레인지","meaning":"煤气灶","explanation":"가스레인지：煤气灶","readings":[{"term":"가스레인지","audio":"/audio/6417b4aff13b3319e6bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14639","senseId":"1","lemma":"가스레인지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불을","meaning":"火","explanation":"불：火；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"1","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끄고","meaning":"熄灭","explanation":"끄다：熄灭；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끄다","audio":"/audio/1e0c0d787abf4da9e67d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73443","senseId":"1","lemma":"끄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올게.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수화기를","meaning":"听筒","explanation":"수화기：听筒；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"수화기","audio":"/audio/636a42c41e960be3d25a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64772","senseId":"1","lemma":"수화기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려놓지","meaning":"放下","explanation":"내려놓다：放下；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"내려놓다","audio":"/audio/bd19ac71b36cbb7b04c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59468","senseId":"1","lemma":"내려놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"一下，暂时地","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57313","definition":"在非常短暂的时间内。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"6417b4aff13b3319","term":"가스레인지","zh":"煤气灶","audio":"/audio/6417b4aff13b3319e6bf.mp3","entryId":"14639","definition":"将煤气作为燃料，加热和蒸煮食物的器具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"物质散发着光和热而燃烧。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e0c0d787abf4da9","term":"끄다","zh":"熄灭","audio":"/audio/1e0c0d787abf4da9e67d.mp3","entryId":"73443","definition":"使燃烧的火不再燃烧。","pronunciation":["끄다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"636a42c41e960be3","term":"수화기","zh":"听筒","audio":"/audio/636a42c41e960be3d25a.mp3","entryId":"64772","definition":"电话机上接听声音的部分。","pronunciation":["수화기"]},{"id":"bd19ac71b36cbb7b","term":"내려놓다","zh":"放下","audio":"/audio/bd19ac71b36cbb7b04c2.mp3","entryId":"59468","definition":"把手里拿着的东西放到下面。","pronunciation":["내려노타"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1311d3ded1ed0adb85d5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64772-1-8-2","ko":"응, 기다리고 있을게.","zh":"嗯，我会等你的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다리고","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을게.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；을게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a38a05305d0103de722.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.193,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64772","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["等一下，敏俊啊。我先把燃气灶的火关了再过来。别挂电话哦。","嗯，我会等你的。","真想念学生时代啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["等一下，敏俊啊。我先把燃气灶的火关了再过来。别挂电话哦。","嗯，我会等你的。","真想念学生时代啊。"],"answer":1}]}
